  "title": "K628b directional spillover re-estimated with a real KPPS generalized FEVD",
  "timestamp": "2026-07-13T10:24:53.108878+00:00",
  "motivation": "k628b_vol_spillover.py documents its decomposition as 'generalized FEVD (Pesaran & Shin, 1998)' but calls statsmodels' results.fevd(), which is the ORTHOGONALISED (Cholesky) FEVD and depends on the order of the variables. K628b ordered SPY first -- the position that mechanically maximises estimated exogeneity -- and then reported SPY as the dominant net transmitter. This re-run replaces the decomposition and changes nothing else.",
